<view class="page-shell works-page"><page-nav title="我的作品"></page-nav><view class="works-top"><view class="works-intro">这些作品文件与文字只属于我的个人记录，不是公开社区。</view></view><view wx:if="{{draftCount}}" class="draft-hint">有 {{draftCount}} 份作品草稿待完善</view><view wx:if="{{works.length}}" class="works-list"><view wx:for="{{works}}" wx:key="id" class="work-card card tap" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="work-art"><view wx:if="{{item.filePath}}" class="work-file-art">▤</view><image wx:elif="{{item.cover}}" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><scene-banner wx:else scene="{{item.scene}}" compact="{{true}}"></scene-banner></view><view class="work-copy"><view class="work-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="work-date">{{item.date}} <text wx:if="{{item.status === 'draft'}}" class="draft-badge">草稿</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.fileName}}" class="work-file-name">▤ {{item.fileName}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.location}}" class="work-location">⌖ {{item.location}}</view><view class="work-views">👁 {{item.views}} 次浏览　♥ {{item.likes}} 点赞</view></view><view class="work-arrow">›</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">还没有作品。<view>点击底部“新建作品”上传第一份文件吧。</view></view><view class="fixed-create-bar"><view class="fixed-create-button tap" bindtap="create">＋ 新建作品</view></view></view>
